# Coincident on an empty sketch: a box B1 from P1 to P2, and a segment L1
# from P3 to P4 near the box's lower right corner, which is derived:
# vertex(B1, 1). Coincident, tool first, merges P4 into that corner, which
# L1 then ends on, then merges P2, the box's second corner, into P3, the
# first picked staying.
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.box
wait 2
click L 360 558
click L 524 449
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 634 284
click L 661 547
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.coincident
wait 2
click L 661 547
click L 524 558
wait 2
click L 634 284
click L 524 449
wait 2
key Escape
wait 4
